发作者：Rick不想上班（全网同名）\n合作(工作流定制/AI写真/商单等)&入群vx：Hunter_C137\nB站主页（技术教程）：https://space.bilibili.com/11954986\n爱发电(高级会员)：https://afdian.com/a/rick_c137\nQQ频道（参与AI活动）：https://pd.qq.com/s/b92mppw1c\n\n所有开发工作流记录：https://or9wdsxpxm.feishu.cn/mindnotes/SBVkbkJhXmSsywnQOhDcQg1QnQc#mindmap\n\n工作流记录图文版：https://or9wdsxpxm.feishu.cn/docx/F94od7dMToC2foxyr0CchNKMnBg?from=from_copylink\n\nRICK白金会员介绍：https://or9wdsxpxm.feishu.cn/mindnotes/OIuYb22fJmbqw1nq4XIcFc2Hneh#mindmap\n\n操作说明：\n1.左上角第一张图上传女生的，第二张上传男生的。\n2.下面那张上传人脸面部朝向参考，对应女生的面部参考，而男生是反转后的朝向。\n3.下面的面部朝向参考照片尽量上传人脸面积占比大的，如果太小会导致还原度不高，而且会导致生成多人。\n注意：本工作流出现额外多人概率比较大，需要再借助图生图进行抹除。\n\n配置要求说明：内存15G，显存13G，没有达到就不用瞎折腾了。\n大模型要使用SDXL，instantid插件爆红或确实模型请下载安装，并参考官方的模型下载和存放位置。\ninstantid插件地址：https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_InstantID\n\n本工作流推荐视频地址：https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13W421A7sy/\n教程视频地址：（待录制..）\n\n\n作者：B站【Rick不想上班】"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [380, 660], "pos": [-1420, -370], "id": 166, "properties": {"text": ""}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Rick", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 429, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [760, 870], "pos": [1540, -320], "id": 159, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 36}], "extra": {"workspace_info": {"saveLock": false, "id": "kArdK_KQtxHI5DfIRQjlM"}, "ue_links": [{"controller": 146, "upstream": "4", "downstream_slot": 4, "downstream": 147, "upstream_slot": 2, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 145, "upstream": "11", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 77, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "INSTANTID"}, {"controller": 145, "upstream": "38", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 77, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "FACEANALYSIS"}, {"controller": 145, "upstream": "16", "downstream_slot": 2, "downstream": 77, "upstream_slot"